			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;We admit that we cannot solve the world's hunger problems. There are many established organizations that are equipped to assist, educate, and provide long term relationships with communities that are in dire need of proper nourishment, medical assistance and continued education. These nonprofit organization serve their purpose well in helping our Hungry Children and communities around the globe.<br />
			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;This is a simple concept and an easy way for you to contribute to helping one child at a time, to provide food, medication and vital necessity for the child.<br />
			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;24,000 people die from hunger every day, or one life lost every 3.6 seconds. Three-fourths of the deaths are children under the age of five. <br />
